            "review_title": "Review at The Anchor Restaurant (Bistro & Boutique)",
            "review_text": "Excursion65037952081\n8 contributions\n0\nGreat intro to Da Nang\nMar 2026 • Couples\nLovely service . Great food meat tougher than expected but think that's a cultural thing.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 20, 2026\nNHÀ HÀNG ANCHOR\nThank you so much for your kind review! 💛\n\nOn behalf of Anchor, we’re truly happy to know we could be part of your introduction to Da Nang. It’s wonderful to hear that you enjoyed the service and overall dining experience.\n\nWe also appreciate your honest feedback regarding the meat texture. Your comments are valuable to us, and we’ll continue working to ensure our dishes meet the expectations of guests from different backgrounds.\n\nWe hope to welcome you back again for another great experience during your time in Da Nang! 🍻\n\nWarm regards,\nAnchor Team\nRead more\nWritten April 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
